\f1\fs24 \cf2 A safe, fast disk cleaner for macOS.\
\pard\tx560\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
\f0\fs22 \cf2 \
Silt measures 123 known cache and log locations across 25+ language ecosystems, finds build artifacts and large files, uninstalls applications with the data they leave behind, and refuses to touch anything it should not.\
\
\f1 Three gates stand in front of every removal\
\f0 A hand-written catalog allow-list, a review-only kind the cleaner re-checks on its own, and per-path rules covering home-folder containment, protected locations, symlinks and traversal. Cleaning moves things to the Trash by default.\
\
\f1 No network access\
\f0 Nothing leaves this Mac. No telemetry, no background agent, no dependencies.\
